Interpretation rule:
- Treat matched_dev_val as the primary evidence.
- fraction_score_increased answers whether Digital-3 editing moves the model in the attack direction.
- same_source_auc asks whether the edited versions rank above their corresponding source population.
- Compare that with the official Digital-3 AUROC, which uses the separate 300-image bona-fide population.
- project_train is secondary because those parent cards were used for model fitting.
